  "description": "Orphaned at a young age, Woo Jung-Won grew up neglected in an orphanage. One day, drowning in debt, the director decides to sell him off. Luckily, Kwon Jun-Seo, a powerful mafioso, arrives just in time—to collect his money. But when he sees Jung-Won being manhandled, something in him shifts. On a whim, he saves the poor boy. For the first time in his life, Jung-Won sees a ray of hope in his dark and bleak world. And from that moment, a flower of hope blooms within him—bright and powerful. But is that flower truly something beautiful? Or is it the beginning of something far more sinister?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
